  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for the Project on Resources and Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project on Resources and Governance (PRG) brings together researchers and practitioners to promote transparent, accountable, and responsible management of natural resources in low- and middle-income countries. During this grant period, PRG will commission at least three new research projects; mentor researchers and practitioners in innovative social science research; and share research results with individuals and groups that influence extractive industries, affected communities, and governments in countries that are dependent on the exploitation of natural resources. (Strategy: Transparency, Participation, and Accountability)</narrative>
  </description>
